From 73d407fe734338973499375d272c0fec6bc804e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 15:11:47 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4002/5749] fix(mcp): bypass env var allowlist for trusted
 skill MCP configs (#3168)

Added 'trusted' option to expandEnvVars. Skill MCPs are user-controlled
and now bypass the security allowlist. 3 files changed.

TDD verified. tsc clean.

Closes #3168
